&lt;p&gt;Posted: N50 02.720 W110 46.760

MyGPSr: N50 02.722 W110 46.758&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After gathering information for the nearby EarthCache, I wandered over to this brass cap location. I had forgotten to bring my notes, but I spotted the three reference cap guard posts, triangulated a bit, and then found the 1&quot; dimple in the ground. There is no longer a guard post marking the actual brass cap. I brushed off a thin layer of dirt and snapped the photo. Nice views from up here. Thanks for another brass cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
